<Description>
<![CDATA[Determines the drive operating mode when “Start Motion” has a zero-to-one transition: 1 = Position; 2 = Speed ; 3 = Home; 4 = Torque ; 5 = Fixed Ratio Gear ; 6 = Index; 7 = CAM; 8 = Variable Ratio Gear.]]>
</Description>
</Member>
<Member Name="MoveType" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Specify the type of move: 0 = Absolute; 1 = Incremental; 2 = Rotary Shortest Path; 3 = Rotary Positive; 4 = Rotary Negative; 7 = Relative; 8 = Capture.]]>
</Description>
</Member>
<Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZraC_UDT_It5" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/>
<Member Name="PositionCommandOverlap" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZraC_UDT_It5" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
