</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(MAN) XIC(HMI_Data.Control.Button[154]) ,XIC(Heater_ON_Manual) ]XIO(HMI_Data.Control.Button[155])XIO(CycleStartLatch)XIC(in_Safety.OK)OTE(Heater_ON_Manual);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
