<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Robot01_Wire_SM.Status.State[41]) ,XIC(Robot01_Wire_SM.Control.Bit[15]) ]XIO(Robot01_Wire_SM.Status.State[44])OTE(Robot01_Wire_SM.Control.Bit[15]);]]>
</Text>
