<Rung Number="154" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[CURE PLACE POINTER

Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Counter[0].ACC = Next Cure Drawer to Load
NOTE: If the 'next' location is not ready (CureStatus=0) when the Robot is ready to place a PCB, the SM
will be stuck in state[42] and so the counter, and thus the 'next' location, will increment after the Timer[0].PRE]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(Robot02_PCB_SM.Status.State[41]) XIC(RobotControl.UserOut1.7) ,XIC(Robot02_PCB_SM.Status.State[42]) ] ONS(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.OS[4]) ,XIC(Place_Request) ]XIO(Place_Latch)OTE(Place_Request);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="155" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Place_Request)[EQ(CureStatus[NextPlace],0) OTE(Place_CMD) ,NE(CureStatus[NextPlace],0) TON(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Timer[0],?,?) ,XIC(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Timer[0].DN) RES(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Timer[0]) [ADD(NextPlace,1,NextPlace) ,EQ(NextPlace,3) MOVE(0,NextPlace) ,ADD(NextPlace,1,HMI_Data.Status.DINT_Disp[0]) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="156" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[CURE PICK POINTER

Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Counter[1].ACC = Next Cure Drawer to Pull From
NOTE: If the 'next' location is not ready (CureStatus=2) when the Robot is ready to pick a PCB, the SM
will be stuck in state[12] and so the counter, and thus the 'next' location, will increment after the Timer[1].PRE]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Robot02_PCB_SM.Status.State[12]) ONS(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.OS[5]) ,XIC(Pick_Request) ]XIO(Pick_Latch)OTE(Pick_Request);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="157" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Pick_Request)[EQ(CureStatus[NextPick],2) OTE(Pick_CMD) ,NE(CureStatus[NextPick],2) TON(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Timer[1],?,?) ,XIC(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Timer[1].DN) RES(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Timer[1]) [ADD(NextPick,1,NextPick) ,EQ(NextPick,3) MOVE(0,NextPick) ,ADD(NextPick,1,HMI_Data.Status.DINT_Disp[1]) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="158" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[CURE STATION TRACKING

Drawer Control]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Place_CMD) ,XIC(Place_Latch) ]EQ(CureStatus[NextPlace],0)XIC(MachineRunning)[EQ(NextPlace,0) OTE(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Bit[5]) ,EQ(NextPlace,1) OTE(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Bit[6]) ,EQ(NextPlace,2) OTE(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Bit[7]) ,OTE(Place_Latch) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="159" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Place_Latch)ONS(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.OS[29])[ADD(NextPlace,1,NextPlace) ,EQ(NextPlace,3) MOVE(0,NextPlace) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="160" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Pick_CMD) ,XIC(Pick_Latch) ]EQ(CureStatus[NextPick],2)XIC(MachineRunning)[EQ(NextPick,0) OTE(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Bit[2]) ,EQ(NextPick,1) OTE(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Bit[3]) ,EQ(NextPick,2) OTE(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.Bit[4]) ,OTE(Pick_Latch) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="161" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Pick_Latch)ONS(Robot02_PCB_SM.Control.OS[30])[ADD(NextPick,1,NextPick) ,EQ(NextPick,3) MOVE(0,NextPick) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
